<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="title">我的家庭</view><view class="link" bindtap="family">家庭与设备</view></view><view class="sub">今天也要一点一点，慢慢完成。</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><picker range="{{children}}" range-key="name" value="{{index}}" bindchange="child"><view class="badge">{{children[index].name || '请先添加孩子'}} · 切换</view></picker><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view>{{date}}</view></picker></view><view class="row"><view>显示所有未完成</view><switch checked="{{pending}}" bindchange="pendingChange" color="#315f53"/></view><view class="heading">{{done}} / {{assignments.length}} 项已勾选完成</view><view class="muted">勾选完成不代表家长已检查。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="importPage">导入消息 · 整理与发布</button><view wx:if="{{!assignments.length}}" class="empty">还没有作业，发布后就会出现在这里。</view><view wx:for="{{assignments}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="badge">{{item.subject}} {{item.priority==='high'?'· 优先':''}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.completed?'已完成':'待完成'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.updated}}" class="warning">内容有更新，请孩子重新确认</view><view class="content {{item.completed?'complete':''}}">{{item.content}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.materials}}">准备：{{item.materials}}</view><view class="muted">截止：{{item.due_date || '未指定'}}</view><button data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggle" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.completed?'取消勾选':'标记完成'}}</button></view><view class="muted">打印和已发布作业编辑，请在网页家长端操作。</view><button bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view>
